  "packProvenanceNote": "South attack reuses exact own idle opening and three newly authored free CPU source-UV ready/thrust/recovery keys,880ms one-shot. All69 prior frames/31 other clips/pivots/body calibration remain exact. Three formerly empty416x352 cells admit the keys in a transparent right-column page extension2048x3968 to2560x3968, preserving every prior atlas/mask pixel. Explicit804 exact own-South donor pixels and633 original joint overlap pixels; no provider/paid jobs, other-facing or private pixels. Native appearance pending. Exact48 original weapon/cuff ownership transfers; authored coaxial tail rest alignment and separate weapon plane depths preserve screen scale/root.",
  "packReadme": "# Human Spearman preview\n\nDefault v1 pack0.14.0 preserves all69 prior poses and31 other clips and adds three own-South ready/thrust/recovery keys, reusing one exact existing idle opening for an880ms one-shot. All8 source walks and SE/NE/E/N attacks remain. The72 frame records contain32 originals,28 earlier authored walks and12 own-facing attack poses (NE/E/N/S).\n\nThe page extends transparently from2048x3968 to2560x3968; the exact old RGBA/mask prefix remains. Three proven empty416x352 slots contain this slice; every prior decoded RGBA byte outside those slots, every old crop/registration/pivot and body calibration remain exact. Conservative rooted bounds admit the weapon. Explicit own-seed donors:804; original joint overlaps:633, counted separately. All source scripts/scenes/raw trials and normalized exports remain retained. No paid/provider jobs, private source, mirrored/borrowed facing or held identity.\n\nSource gaps at inspected 6ee1cce4 plus this slice: Spearman10 (attack SW/W/NW; defeat N/NE/E/S/SW/W/NW), Infantry21, Archer21:52 military source cells. All63 original native/deployed cells remain unverified. The full builder replays seven directional walk stages then NE/E/N/S attack stages. Last-stage repeat: append-spearman-public-seed-action.py south.\n\nThe exact48 original moving wood/cuff fringe samples transfer to the weapon/forearm with no alpha deletion or added donors. Authored fixed coaxial tail alignment and upper/tail depths -0.04/-0.045 remove source-axis and coplanar render defects; source UVs and camera/body scale remain fixed.\n",
